    "title": "Lee School Committee greenlights 3.3 percent increase for FY27 budget, year over year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Leslee Bassman ,\n10 hours ago Lee — The town’s School Committee unanimously approved a $13.91 million budget for FY27, or an uptick of about $516,709 representing a 3.86 percent increase, year over year. However, due to state programs and grants totaling about $1.66 million, that budget is reduced to $12.25 million, or an uptick of 3.3 percent representing an added $391,663, year over year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
